## Interface Contracts

### HybridTradingEnv ↔ Models / RL Agents
- `env.action_space`: `spaces.Tuple((spaces.Discrete(3), spaces.Box(0.0, 1.0, shape=(1,), dtype=np.float32)))`
- `env.step(action)` -> `(obs, reward, terminated, truncated, info)`
  - `obs`: `np.ndarray` of shape `(obs_dim,)`, `dtype=np.float32`
  - `reward`: `float` (log equity change)
  - `terminated`: `bool` (bankruptcy: equity < 5% initial cash)
  - `truncated`: `bool` (end of dataset stream)
  - `info`: `dict` containing `{"total_equity": float, "cash_balance": float, "holding_quantity": int, "current_price": float, "trade_record": Optional[TradeRecord]}`

### SL Feature Extractor ↔ RL Policy
- `SLFeatureExtractor.forward(x)` -> `torch.Tensor` of shape `(batch_size, latent_dim)`
- `HybridActorCritic`:
  - `forward(obs)` -> `(action_logits, weight_mu, weight_std, value)`
  - `sample_action(obs)` -> `((act_type, weight), log_prob, value)`

### HPO Pipeline ↔ Results Exporter
- `evaluate_trading_performance(env_history)` -> `dict` containing `{"total_equity": float, "total_return_pct": float, "sharpe_ratio": float, "max_drawdown_pct": float}`
- `export_trial_to_csv(trial_data, csv_path="etc/hpo_results/baseline_hpo.csv")` -> appends row with atomic file write.

## Code Layout
- `modules/engine/hybrid_trading_env.py` — Gymnasium 1.2.0 Hybrid Trading Environment [DONE]
- `modules/models/feature_extractor.py` — SL 1D-CNN and MLP Feature Extractors [M2]
- `modules/models/hybrid_policy.py` — Hybrid Actor-Critic Policy & SB3 Continuous Adapter [M2]
- `modules/hpo/__init__.py` — HPO Package [M3]
- `modules/hpo/metrics.py` — Financial & RL Performance Metrics [M3]
- `modules/hpo/optuna_pipeline.py` — Optuna Study & Objective Runner [M3]
- `modules/hpo/exporter.py` — CSV Results Exporter [M3]
- `scripts/run_hpo.py` — CLI Runner [M3]
- `tests/test_hpo_pipeline.py` — Comprehensive Test Suite [M4]
- `etc/hpo_results/` — HPO output CSV and artifact storage [M3]
